{
  "_note": "Forms plugin definitions: the contact form of the source (Joomla com_contact: Name, Email, Phone, Subject, Message; the labels are the contact-info entry's, shown as placeholders like the source) and the newsletter band (AcyMailing, one email field; bound to the Forms plugin, which stores the submissions only, DECISIONS D13). Created by tools/seed-apply.mjs forms. Not carried: the confirmation line of the newsletter box (not in the source) and the 'Send a copy to yourself' checkbox (the Forms plugin sends no copy to the sender).",
